.TH KLVTOOL-DOCTOR 1 "1970-01-01" "klvtool dev" "User Commands"
.SH "NAME"
klvtool\-doctor \- Check backend availability, detected versions, and install guidance.
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
klvtool doctor
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Probe for required external backends (currently ffmpeg/ffprobe), report detected versions, and print platform\-specific install guidance when something is missing or unhealthy. Run this after installing klvtool to confirm the environment is ready.
.SH "EXAMPLES"
Verify the environment is ready
.RS 4
.nf
$ klvtool doctor
.fi
.RE
.SH "EXIT STATUS"
.TP
\fB0\fR
all backends healthy
.TP
\fB1\fR
one or more backends unhealthy or missing
.TP
\fB2\fR
invalid usage
.SH "ENVIRONMENT"
.TP
\fBNO_COLOR\fR
disable ANSI color in pretty output
.SH "REQUIRED TOOLS"
ffmpeg, ffprobe
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBklvtool\fR(1),
\fBklvtool\-diagnose\fR(1)
